1️⃣ Climbing Stairs — LeetCode #70 ⭐
class Solution {
    public int climbStairs(int n) {


        if (n <= 2) {
            return n;
        }


        int a = 1;
        int b = 2;


        for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {
            int c = a + b;
            a = b;
            b = c;
        }


        return b;
    }
}

Example:

n = 5
Output = 8

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1) ✅

2️⃣ House Robber — LeetCode #198 ⭐⭐⭐
class Solution {
    public int rob(int[] nums) {


        int prev2 = 0;
        int prev1 = 0;


        for (int money : nums) {


            int current = Math.max(
                prev1,
                prev2 + money
            );


            prev2 = prev1;
            prev1 = current;
        }


        return prev1;
    }
}

Example:

nums = [2,7,9,3,1]


Output = 12

Because:

2 + 9 + 1 = 12

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1) ✅

3️⃣ Maximum Subarray — LeetCode #53 ⭐⭐⭐
class Solution {
    public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {


        int current = nums[0];
        int maximum = nums[0];


        for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {


            current = Math.max(
                nums[i],
                current + nums[i]
            );


            maximum = Math.max(maximum, current);
        }


        return maximum;
    }
}

Example:

nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]


Output = 6

Maximum subarray:

[4,-1,2,1]
